[00:06.20]Here we stand, open arms
{"我们张开双臂伫立于此"}
[00:09.62]This is home where we are
{"这里就是我们归属的家园"}
[00:13.20]Ever strong in the world that we made
{"在我们创造的世界里永远坚强"}
[00:20.21]I still hear you in the breeze
{"我仍能在微风中听见你"}
[00:23.76]See your shadows in the trees
{"在树影间看见你的轮廓"}
[00:27.30]Holding on, memories never change
{"紧握那些永不褪色的回忆"}
[00:33.95]
[02:30.88]Summer in the hills
{"山间的夏日时光"}
[02:33.85]Those hazy days I do remember
{"那些朦胧日子我仍铭记"}
[02:37.71]We were running still
{"我们仍在奔跑"}
[02:40.35]Had the whole world at our feet
{"仿佛世界尽在脚下"}
[02:44.16]Watching seasons change
{"见证四季更迭"}
[02:47.14]Our roads were lined with adventure
{"我们的路途铺满奇遇"}
[02:50.93]Mountains in the way
{"群山阻隔前路"}
[02:53.75]Couldn't keep us from the sea
{"却无法阻挡我们奔赴海洋"}
[02:56.65]
